#: ../../session_management.rst:3
msgid "Manage connected browsers and devices"
msgstr "Bainistigh brabhsálaithe agus gléasanna nasctha"

#: ../../session_management.rst:5
msgid ""
"The personal settings page gives you an overview of the connected browsers "
"and devices under the \"Security\" tab."
msgstr ""
"Tugann an leathanach socruithe pearsanta forbhreathnú duit ar na "
"brabhsálaithe agus na feistí atá nasctha, faoin gcluaisín \"Slándáil\"."

#: ../../session_management.rst:9
msgid "Managing connected browsers and devices"
msgstr "Brabhsálaithe agus gléasanna nasctha a bhainistiú"

#: ../../session_management.rst:12
msgid ""
"The list of connected browsers and devices shows which browsers and devices "
"have connected to your account recently:"
msgstr ""
"Léiríonn an liosta de bhrabhsálaithe agus de ghléasanna nasctha cé na "
"brabhsálaithe agus na gléasanna a nasc le do chuntas le déanaí:"

#: ../../session_management.rst:15
msgid "List of browser and device sessions."
msgstr "Liosta de sheisiúin bhrabhsálaí agus ghléis."

#: ../../session_management.rst:18
msgid ""
"You can open the menu beside every device or session to revoke the access."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an roghchlár in aice le gach gléas nó seisiún a oscailt chun "
"an rochtain a chúlghairm."

#: ../../session_management.rst:20
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the list, you can create a new device-specific password. "
"The generated password is used for configuring the new client. Ideally, "
"generate individual tokens for every device you connect to your account, so "
"you can disconnect those individually if necessary:"
msgstr ""
"Ag bun an liosta, is féidir leat pasfhocal nua a chruthú atá sonrach don "
"fheiste. Úsáidtear an pasfhocal a ghintear chun an cliant nua a chumrú. Is "
"fearr comharthaí (tokens) ar leith a ghiniúint do gach feiste a nascann tú "
"le do chuntas, ionas gur féidir leat iad a dhínascadh ina n-aonar más gá:"

#: ../../session_management.rst:25
msgid "Adding a new device."
msgstr "Gléas nua á chur leis."

#: ../../session_management.rst:28
msgid "Your generated token is shown."
msgstr "Tá an comhartha a ghin tú ar taispeáint."

#: ../../session_management.rst:32
msgid ""
"You only have access to the device password when creating it. Nextcloud does"
" not save the plain password, so enter the password on the new client "
"immediately."
msgstr ""
"Ní bhíonn rochtain agat ar phasfhocal an ghléis ach amháin le linn é a "
"chruthú. Ní shábhálann Nextcloud an pasfhocal ina fhoirm shimplí, mar sin "
"cuir an pasfhocal isteach sa chliant nua láithreach."

#: ../../session_management.rst:38
msgid ""
"If you use :doc:`user_2fa` for your account, device-specific passwords are "
"the only way to configure clients. The server will then deny connections "
"from clients using your login password."
msgstr ""
"Má úsáideann tú :doc:`user_2fa` do do chuntas, is iad pasfhocail a bhaineann"
" go sonrach le gléas an t-aon bhealach chun cliant a chumrú. Diúltóidh an "
"freastalaí ansin do naisc ó chliaint a úsáideann do phasfhocal logála "
"isteach."

#: ../../session_management.rst:43
msgid "Device-specific passwords and password changes"
msgstr "Pasfhocail a bhaineann go sonrach le gléas agus athruithe pasfhocail"

#: ../../session_management.rst:45
msgid ""
"When a password changes in an external user backend, all device-specific "
"passwords are marked as invalid. Once you log in with the main password, all"
" device-specific passwords are updated and work again."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a athraítear pasfhocal i gcóras cúil seachtrach d’úsáideoirí, "
"marcáiltear gach pasfhocal a bhaineann le gléas ar leith mar phasfhocal "
"neamhbhailí. Nuair a logálann tú isteach leis an bpríomhphasfhocal, déantar "
"na pasfhocail a bhaineann le gléasanna ar leith a nuashonrú agus bíonn siad "
"ag obair arís."
